    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nfrom scipy import stats\n\n\ndef between(n, p, low, high):\n    dist = stats.binom(n, p)\n    return round(float(dist.cdf(high) - dist.cdf(low - 1)), 4)\n\n\nprint(between(20, 0.114, 2, 3))\nprint(between(10, 0.5, 4, 6))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nfrom scipy import stats\n\n\ndef between(n, p, low, high):\n    dist = stats.binom(n, p)\n    return round(float(dist.cdf(high) - dist.cdf(low - 1)), 4)\n\n\nprint(between(20, 0.114, 2, 3))\nprint(between(10, 0.5, 4, 6))\n```"
    }
